    {
      "name": "Password reset & change",
      "description": "Self-contained: run the whole folder in order. No e-mail server is used: an Administrator issues a one-time reset code (valid 30 min, stored only as a SHA-256 hash) and gives it to the user, who sets a new password with it. A reset or password change logs out the account's other sessions. The requests set Maria's password back to attendee123, so the demo login keeps working.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "let j = {}; try { j = pm.response.json() || {}; } catch (e) {}",
                  "if (j.csrf) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"csrf\", j.csrf);",
                  "pm.test(\"status is 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
